(
    title: "Dodge \'Em",
    developer: Some("Carla Meninsky"),
    description: Some("Your car circles four concentric lanes hoovering up dots while a computer car runs the loop the other way, hunting you head-on. The joystick shifts lanes through the track\'s four gaps and the button is a gas pedal for accelerating out of trouble; clearing the dots earns a bonus and a fresh set, three crashes end a heat, and a second joystick puts a rival driver in the other car."),
